Spreewald v1.1 (2.02)    2v2

Updated for 2.02 patch

April 1945 - General Busse's beleagured army attempts to break through to General Wenck in the Pine forests south of Berlin.
Marshall Konevs army group from the east and south and Zhukovs from the north attempt to encircle.

Your units will start out damaged from the recent bitter fighting. Some of your further reinforcments will also be damaged - remember to heal and repair as they arrive.

There is one bomber each upon the capture of the start zeppelin in each opposing corner. There is an improvised airstrip at the rear on each side.

Units will arrive every 10 minutes until approx 40 minutes from the start.

There is no artillery available on this map.

Only USSR and German units are available. GB and USA will play as USSR. Japan will play as Germany.

